  "description": "The COMMENCAL SUPREME DH V5.2 SIGNATURE is a race-bred DH machine for speed, jumps and technical park lines.\n• FOX 40 Factory and FOX Float X2 Factory deliver precise suspension control when impacts stack up at race pace.\n• SRAM Maven Silver 4-piston brakes with 220 mm rotors bring strong, progressive braking into high-speed corners.\n• DT SWISS FR541/FR571 wheels with 350 hubs combine front grip, rear toughness and a freer suspension feel.\n• SRAM GX DH 7-speed with E13 hardware keeps the drivetrain robust and responsive when every pedal stroke counts.\nA gravity bike for riders chasing cleaner lines, harder hits and more speed between the tape.",
